Provides: openjdk-8-jre, openjdk-8-jre-headless, java-compiler, java-runtime, java-runtime-headless, java-sdk, java-sdk-headless, java8-runtime, java8-runtime-headless, java8-sdk, java8-sdk-headless
Homepage: https://download.opensuse.org/ports/riscv/tumbleweed/repo/oss/riscv64/
Description: openSUSE OpenJDK 8 Zero VM for Debian riscv64
 This package repacks the openSUSE Tumbleweed riscv64 OpenJDK 8
 RPM packages as a Debian riscv64 package. It installs under
 /usr/lib/jvm and registers common JDK commands with update-alternatives.
